    "typ.miai88rd.8fu6": {
      "id": "typ.miai88rd.8fu6",
      "name": "UploadFileList",
      "description": "A list of files returned by  Upload bucket",
      "doc": "Result for the `/upload/list` endpoint.\n\nSome notes:\n\n- `truncated`: is boolean indicating whether the list of results was truncated. If `true`, there are more objects matching the request that were not returned, and the `cursor` property will be present.\n- `cursor`: an optional string token used for pagination. It is present **only if `truncated` is `true`**. To fetch the next page of results, you must pass this cursor string into the `cursor` option of your subsequent `/upload/list` call\n\nNOTE: at the moment (for performance reasons) there is no way to know how many objects are saved inside a specific *folder*.\n",
      "db_table": "",
      "db_clear": false,
      "fields": [
